     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-latino-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-latino-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-latino-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\" title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. When building this specification, the most recent version 1.3 has been used\"> version ⏿1.3</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2166-7\">2166-7</a></td><td>Argentinian</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2168-3\">2168-3</a></td><td>Chilean</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2169-1\">2169-1</a></td><td>Colombian</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2156-8\">2156-8</a></td><td>Costa Rican</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2182-4\">2182-4</a></td><td>Cuban</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2184-0\">2184-0</a></td><td>Dominican</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2170-9\">2170-9</a></td><td>Ecuadorian</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2157-6\">2157-6</a></td><td>Guatemalan</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2158-4\">2158-4</a></td><td>Honduran</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2148-5\">2148-5</a></td><td>Mexican</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2151-9\">2151-9</a></td><td>Chicano/a</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2159-2\">2159-2</a></td><td>Nicaraguan</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http:/